<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="h">2 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc1">Peter ne Raukegai Laisiu Kenabe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Peter Kenabe</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Pet.</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Peter</para>
  <para style="mt">Peter ne Raukegai Laisiu Kenabe</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Peter laisiu kenabe de AD 66 dau raupwa Peter laisiu keraibe raukegai Khristianme maa dage kai. Khristianme aidungde cu au mine teikeherei kecu kengngi ga mene kemret keledeume ne kelwak kecu kengngi ga bamdi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Peter Khristianme de kemret keledeume de renia kecu yitube lampui au Khristianme kenlumde ga lungh nah reli eh lungh eh ngkieng kelude lie ranggai. Pa penui dage Tinggwang kemret keledeume de ngkapdi zielie ranggai. Jisu cailigwang kera pe sampet de kaipwa bambi zie kecune, Peter Khristianme aidungde de “mci nah kemci teilung” lungh lulo ranggai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Keraisam (1:1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Maci kesangbe (1:3-21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kemret keledeume nah penui kekap (2:1-22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Rampaube tingba (3:1-18)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="s">Samkeraibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Laisiu aide Simon Peter, Jisu Khrista kila nah langkegaibe ne raupwa anui Tinggwang nah kelikelube Jisu Khrista masangbe ga anui nzwa ngaukelu kenlum pemi kehung kenlummedung dage kekai. <verse eid="2PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Tinggwang nah anui Rampaube Jisu de cikelu gade peu n da ngaugia nah lungciep bamkiee kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Qukelu nah kedet kelude cisiak kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Tinggwang pe rabe kengkieng gade ma pelane anuide peu dida nah kemci teilung lunghlu kera Tinggwang maci gade anuide pe kendu nah keyi gage qu gailu. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Ainzwa eh pane anuide sampet kebeu mapeu kedi nah pemi kehung peu pwabam, iciu eh mapeu aidungde gade nnui kideu aide hengin kapdi keladung gade mbailu, nah rabe luilung de mzilu kerane. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Dede makie aide ziemne, n kenlum gage keyi silu kera nnui laikai teilu; delwe keyi gage, maci silu; <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />maci gage, nnuide kezeu silu; nnuide kehezeu gage, liakecu silu; liakecu ga kemci teilung silu; <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />kemci teilung ga, caihereiswacing kereku kecu silu; nah caihereiswacing kereku ga, keku silu. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Aidungde nnuida bam eh mmicuh lucai, anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista gade maci de petsi builu takedi tei dilak. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Dede aidungde peda bam kemak keheibede pe kecet duidi nah pe miak cietdi eh, ndaa pa kemau teikedidung teimci kedide nsungta dila. <verse eid="2PE 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Cine, sinamedung, nnuide qukelu nah kedet kelude ga ntip eh nnui laikai teibam lulo, cinzwa eh nnui aidungde tei lucai nnui madaude kau dilak. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Kedanemene ainzwa eh nnui ziemne kelikelube Rampaube Jisu Khrista gade kelungta hegwangram cika nlütlu kebuime tei beuzie. <verse eid="2PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Cine Ih aidungde nnui dage rang nsungbeu kera mtei pwabam muizie, nnui cidungde cilu delie eh nah nnui kesangbe ga sapntip bamdi delie de. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Dede a kecet au Ih paiki aika kebamtane, nnuide teimrak gaidai kerade petau bam. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista gade aide acu keukelia nzwa eh, Ih agu paiki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Paiki </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pumteihbe teilung de rangbam</char></note> de pütdi kera nna kedi Ih cibam dida lu. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Dede a tsit cai ma aidungde nnui ngau eh nsungla muilu kerane Ih a laikai tei eh nnuide ranglia maisia bam. <verse eid="2PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Kedanemene anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista gwang kerade de peu ci kegaidau anui ma rasamdung mpwak kelu ha rang ma, dede pe kengkieng kedi anui miak gade ngauda. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Peibe Tinggwang dade pa hetwa nah kendu kengau nah makwa cide pe kengkieng kendu gade pe dage ranggai, “Aide a Na Akube, Ih pecu a suitube da.” <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Anui pecu lamlwa kemci ga ngngwa keladau, makwa aide Tinggim gade kegwang anui siuda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:1-5">Mat. 17:1-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Cine anui au cairasam aide nlum reureu di, delwe nnui cide gage helungkai lucai yi luzie, kedanemene mibung ge kemui ga baa kebam nzwa, delwe tingba pet kemaktane, tingcang hegi nnui mlungdung ga baa cuhlu kera. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Ma pelane reude, migede pekatei kesanglaisiu ga caihakecisam mina suibe gade gwang eh ranggai kelak nnui cilu maisia. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Kedanemene madaude caihakecisam mina lungning gade gwang ma, dede Tinggwang dade Kemci Rabe ne mina lung teigai beu la.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Kemret keledeume nah penui kekap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Dede kemret caihakecime mina kakga gwang da, cinzwa eh kemret keledeume nnui kakga gwangzie. Penuida ngkim kekap, kesang kemak samdung penui teu gwangzie, nah penui penuide lui kelube keledeube dede mlai dizie. Cine penuikatei penui reuga ge kekap teukelwa gwang luzie. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Mina kekiee penui kemmha zaidung mzui zie, penui tei kegaide ziemne, nah kesang lampuibe de ha rangmsia zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:24">Rom. 2:24</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 36:22">Eze. 36:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Penui hengin gade penui nnuide kemret samdung le cwazie. Ndaa gade penui kemmau au mtak ma nah penui kengkap au zipdi lama. <verse eid="2PE 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Kedanemene tinggimgwame kemau tei kedime de Tinggwang pütdi ma. Dede, pa penuide mijaai gage kelien gaidi, cika penui tutiak tingba kemaktane kwa eh penuide kemui ngkanglebie hekwaki gage kangpwa bam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-4">Ken. 6:1-4</ref></char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">kesa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">tutiak tingba kemaktane kemui ngkanglebie hekwaki gage kaizeudi kerane peila</char> </note> <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Tinggwang kideu kehegwabede de püt dima. Meliene, pa kemau ketei kideu gage pa duinai teugwang kecudau, pa Noah, makesang zierang tei kegaibe nah mina kedadung hanghena de si eh kelibeu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Ken. 6:5-8</ref>;<ref loc="GEN 7:23">7:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Tinggwang Sodom nah Gomorrah namdi kena de mimüt ge teidi nah penuide mmau eh ngkapdi, cide le teu nlum kemakme dage daipai teidi ziebi kecu cidungde saulia ge teigai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-29">Ken. 19:1-29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Dede pa kesamsangme ge Lot de kelilu, hezai si kemak minadung kemmha zaireli ne pe lung teikeherei süt.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:12-15">Ken. 19:12-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Cine mina kesamsangme ge, penui kakga lungh kebamme, nah tingnai gecai tingnai ge eh pa penui ta kesiadung siu nah ngau eh pelung kehereisüt bamla. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Rampaube dainzwa eh kemcime de penuide kehedei gade kelilu maisiabi kecu nah dainzwa eh kenlienme de tutiak tingba benai ziemne saja ketei kang gage kaizeu labi kecu cibam, <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />dede bamkeraide penui pumteih hengin keheradung caisui kelame nah Tinggwang kengkieng mlai kelame. Kemret keledeume aidungde kuu nah ngang la, nah hezai keteumede de penui rangmsia kecu hing lama. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Dede tinggimgwame swade ngkiengki nah diki kelame liede Rampaube dwade penuide kemmau tutiak samrang teugwang lama. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Dede mina aidungde makaunedung tuilwe daptset di kerabedung nzwa penui ma cetla kemakme. Ainzwa eh, penui ci kemakpe penui mmau lala. Penuide de makaunedung nzwa ngkap dizie. <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Penui mide teikeherei kecu ziemne penuide keherei le penui ziehi tei beuzie. Penui kecet au ting kebaadau penui pumteih lungningbe teikela penui sui lala. Penui nnuide ngngwa ketaktyei nsam bamde penui kecwa ta tei kecu ga penui sui yila. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Penui miak au kemmha le puipung, nah penui au madaude kemau ketei mtak lama. Penui kemnei kemau ta tei bamkela dene kemeu lala, penui ma kehengindung le penui mlung de ledeu luda. Penui Tinggwang reset kepung namedung! <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Lampui kemzuibe gidi eh penui tetkah dida, penui Balaam, Boer napei lampuibe mzuila dida, pa masang kemak kemau ketei mmi luuneu lala.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:5-7">Pum. 22:5-7</ref></char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">Balaam, Bosor napei peila</char> </note> <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Dede pa pe mau ziemne pecu kesiu, gada ge mina kwa gade samrang eh caihakecibe kemie de kaamdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:26-31">Pum. 22:26-31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Mina aidungde duirwakdung cangh kedibe nzwa nah rahang ne mongzui guipung kelabe nzwa da. Penui ziemne kemui coktu ga heni ge mtei pwabam. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Penui hegie eh kemtabe sam rang kelane, penui minade pumteihbe lungning kemmha gade kemeu la. Penui mina kemau teilung gade mbai kera tei kelamedung de kemeu la. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Penui penui katei au heta kengkap kilabaangme teila liede cidung dage suirang sampet peula. Kedanemene mina au ma keheibe ne pecu ngam lucai pa cipau baang teila delu. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Magade midungge anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista de cikelu gade kideube kekap kengkieng gade mbailwe, cidungde ne penuide nimlwe ngamdai dicai, penui ziemne kekambe au keraibe swade siaki dila. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Cine penui ziemne cide cilwe penuide peu aja kemcibe gade nreutet kecu swa madaude kesang lampui cide ci kemakpe yiki zie. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Aide penui dage macisam kesangde gwang kecude da: “Heteu ge pe nruiga cailigwang dila, nah huimci kedi hebak ge nyasai ga cailigwang daila.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 26:11">Mac. 26:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Rampaube tingba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Akumedung, Ih nnui dage aide laisiu raukegai pe kenabe da; nah kenana gade Ih sam aidungde nnuide nsunglu kerane nnuide kecung gaila, <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Iciu eh ndaa nnui kemci caihakecime rangkebeu samdungde nah langkegaimedung dade Rampaube nah kelikelube aja kaikebeu de nsung luzie. <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Keraibe nnui aide cilu, cide kekamle tingdau mide keuhenui teikelame penui tei keneu rehi gade mide keuhenui tei eh gwangzie. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Penui rangzie, “Daiga pa gwang kera samkai kebeu bamno? Anui paumedung tsaikedi gade ndaa kendeu raitu nzwa jüja la.” <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Penui ndaa Tinggwang sam le tingkideu teikelu cika eh cikemak nzwa dizie, Tinggwang sam le kideube au dui gade nah duile teilu,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:6-9">Ken. 1:6-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />nah aidungde gade, cipau tingdau kideu de, duinai kegai gade dui kedine tei ngkapdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:11-21">Ken. 7:11-21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Dede tinggim nah kideu cu kebamde Tinggwang sam ne kezeu pwabam iciu eh mi ne ngkapdi kerane. Cidungde au mci kemakme tutiak nah ngkapdi kerane kaipwa bam. <verse eid="2PE 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Dede mage nsungta diso, akumedung, Rampaube dwade au tingnaige de mmi cangge nzwa, nah mmi cangge de tingnaige nzwalie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 90:4">Lei. 90:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Midungge cet kela nzwa eh Rampaube au pe sampetdung teibeu kera nneu lama. Meliene, peu nnui migede de kapdi neu mene nnui dade pe lungtie bamla. Dede pelane de penui mau gade nreudi neula.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:3-4">Hab. 2:3-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Iciuliede, Rampaube cailikegwang tingba keregame ge nzwa gwangzie, iciu eh makwa ge sahbak eh tinggim gah dizie. Dede Tinggim pumgimdung mi ne ru dizie, nah kideube nah pe reuga heta leune de liagai dizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga, Tinggim pumgimdung mi ne ru dizie, </char><char style="fqa">nah kideube nah pereu ga heta leune de rugai dizie lie peila </char> </note> <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Aiciu eh ma aidung pelane ngkap dizie nnui mina daikenzwadung ge lu maisia no? Nnui zai mci nah masang lu, <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />Tinggwang cailigwang kera tingba de regui nah kelwa eh kwa bamlu, cide ziemne tinggimdung mi ne ngkap dizie nah tinggim pumgimdung kelum ne teisui dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Isa. 34:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Dede anui pe sampet kai kebeude nzwa eh, anui makesang lungh kera tinggimdung keheci, nah kideu keheci ge kwa bam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:21">Isa. 60:21</ref>;<ref loc="ISA 65:17">65:17</ref>;<ref loc="ISA 66:22">66:22</ref>, <ref loc="REV 21:1">Keu. 21:1</ref>,<ref loc="REV 21:27">27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Ciziemne, akumedung, nnui aidungde regui eh kebam nzwa, lungciep gade nnui pe dwaga mci nah kemau gah eh nnui laikai teibam lulo. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Anui Rampaube helungketie kelilu kera peting keyi peu aulie kecu cet lulo, anui hungkelabe sinabe Paul de pecu kepeu maci de gade nnui dage pe laisiu gade raugai kecude nzwa eh, <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />pa pe laisiu pelane gade aipau hade ainzwa rangla. Pe laisiudung ga maci kepadung gede la, cide maci kemakme nah ntip kemakme rang neula la, penui kesanglaisiu kedabedung tei kela nzwa penui kekap teugwang luda. <verse eid="2PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Ciziemne, akumedung nnui ma aidungde pedwa cibam dida, cine mriak lulo, iciu eh nnuide mina hezai kegahme maula kedide ne cwateudi melu kerane nah nnui masang de tei nggahdi melu kerane. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Dede ngaugia nah anui Rampaube nah kelikelube Jisu Khrista maci gade lungh bamlu. Pecu peu ndu kelube teilo cu nah kelungta. Amen!<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>